      "content": "That's a good starting point, but my creative team needs more specifics to actually build out the lookbooks and select influencers. They need to know who these people actually *look* like and the specific cultural vibes they represent. \n\nCould you flesh out two or three distinct personas? For example, give me a breakdown of one persona that represents \"Old Money/Tradition\" and another that represents \"New Luxury/Global Elite.\" Please include specifics on their likely ethnic/racial backgrounds, the types of cultural heritage they lean into, and where they typically spend their time. It'll help us make sure the visual storytelling feels authentic to the segment.",
